+# F1.1.1 — Room Hardening & Regression Gates
+
+Date: 2026-11-14 · Base commit: `a316f53`
+
+## Scope
+
+Hardening only. No UI addons, Navigation, Turso or FFI.
+
+## Validation evidence
+
+| Check | Result |
+| --- | --- |
+| `bun run typecheck` | PASS |
+| `bun test packages tests` | PASS: 80 tests, 511 assertions |
+| `bun run check:astro` | PASS |
+| `bun run templates:check` | PASS |
+| `bun run build` | PASS |
+| Minimal Android smoke | PASS: APK 11,616,638 bytes, 4 unit tests |
+| Room Android smoke | PASS: assembleDebug, testDebugUnitTest, compileDebugAndroidTestKotlin, lintDebug, schema export |
+| KSP generated `NoteDao_Impl` | PASS |
+| Determinism API/CLI | PASS |
+| Patch apply (F1.0 → F1.1 → F1.1.1) | PASS |
+
+## Version diagnosis
+
+- KSP 2.3.12 does not have a matching Compose compiler plugin.
+- Latest common Kotlin version for KSP and Compose compiler is 2.3.10.
+- Room 2.8.5 builds with KSP 2.3.10 and Kotlin 2.3.10.
+- AGP 9.5.1 supports KGP 2.2.10+, so 2.3.10 is valid.
+- Template therefore uses Kotlin/KGP/KSP/Compose 2.3.10.
+
+## Persistence
+
+- `NoteDaoTest` uses a real in-memory Room database.
+- Covered: insert, select, update, delete.
+- Flow/reactive observation and database close are present in code; no live
+  device/emulator was available, so instrumented tests were compiled but NOT RUN.
+- JVM test covers `NoteEntity` default id.
+
+## Schema
+
+- Room exports `app/schemas/.../1.json` during build.
+- The schema JSON is now included in the generated ZIP as a deterministic file.
+
+## Remaining limitations
+
+- No device/emulator; instrumented tests compiled only.
+- PowerShell scripts still unverified.
+- Room addon remains beta? It is currently `stable` in the manifest; persistence
+  execution evidence is compile-only, so this status should be reviewed if strict
+  runtime evidence is required.
+EOF
+echo ok
\ No newline at end of file
